# --fix rewrites a stale skill this necro carries; one it doesn't carry stays
spec: Packs; Fixes
args: --fix --format terse
exit: 1
-- necro.yaml --
version: 0
include: [necro:agent-files]
-- .agents/skills/necro/SKILL.md --
---
name: necro
description: old
metadata:
  necro-version: "0.0.1"
---
Old.
-- .claude/skills/necro -> ../../.agents/skills/necro --
-- .agents/skills/gone/SKILL.md --
---
name: gone
description: old
metadata:
  necro-version: "0.0.1"
---
-- .claude/skills/gone -> ../../.agents/skills/gone --
-- @stdout --
necro: fixed 1 hit in 1 file (agent-files/stale-skill ×1); review and re-stage them. Why: necro --explain agent-files/stale-skill
necro: 1 hit can't be fixed automatically:
.agents/skills/gone/SKILL.md:5:1: agent-files/stale-skill a necro skill from another necro version
-- @file .agents/skills/necro/SKILL.md --
---
name: necro
…
  necro-version: "<version>"
---
…
